WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:41.480
My lord, you guessed it right.

01:41.560 --> 01:43.320
Ji Shuran did go
to see the Imperial Diviner.

01:45.000 --> 01:47.440
First, a will-o'-the-wisp
outside Eldest Princess's Mansion,

01:47.520 --> 01:49.320
then an exorcism at the Jiang Residence.

01:49.400 --> 01:50.560
The Imperial Diviner

01:51.200 --> 01:53.680
doesn't work
for the imperial court anymore.

01:53.760 --> 01:55.360
Let's take them down
in one fell swoop then.

01:55.440 --> 01:57.280
This is the map
of the Imperial Diviner Office.

01:57.360 --> 01:58.720
I've sent our men to check it out.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.520
My lord, Ms. Jiang Li has arrived.

02:09.759 --> 02:11.320
My lord, Ms. Jiang Li is here.

02:20.040 --> 02:21.680
Sorry to disturb you so late at night.

02:21.760 --> 02:23.840
I didn't expect you to be busy
with official duties.

02:24.360 --> 02:25.280
I'm sorry about that.

02:25.840 --> 02:28.600
It's all right. We're just playing Go.

02:28.680 --> 02:30.160
Are you interested in joining us, Li?

02:30.720 --> 02:32.520
I'm here to ask for a favor,

02:33.160 --> 02:34.400
so I can't stay long.

02:34.480 --> 02:35.520
Another favor?

02:36.040 --> 02:37.000
It's in your interest,

02:37.560 --> 02:38.760
so it's not overstepping.

02:38.840 --> 02:39.800
I'm all ears.

02:39.880 --> 02:42.040
Do you want to get rid
of the Imperial Diviner, Duke Su?

02:42.120 --> 02:43.160
Did you eavesdrop on us?

02:49.720 --> 02:51.600
I came with your staff,

02:52.640 --> 02:54.880
so I didn't have a chance
to eavesdrop on you.

02:54.960 --> 02:56.600
But now it seems like

02:56.680 --> 02:58.120
I've come at the right time.

02:58.200 --> 03:00.480
Is it about the Jiang family's exorcism?

03:00.560 --> 03:03.280
Yes, my stepmother persuaded my father

03:03.360 --> 03:05.600
to invite the Imperial Diviner
for exorcism at our house.

03:06.160 --> 03:07.640
I find this unusual.

03:08.640 --> 03:11.880
She alone can't persuade
the Imperial Diviner to help her.

03:12.440 --> 03:13.720
After much deliberation,

03:13.800 --> 03:16.680
the only person I have offended
and can command the Imperial Diviner

03:16.760 --> 03:18.400
is Eldest Princess Wanning.

03:19.040 --> 03:20.840
The Imperial Diviner
is in charge of palace rituals.

03:20.920 --> 03:22.160
This concerns the imperial family.

03:22.240 --> 03:24.080
Now that he's working for someone else,

03:24.160 --> 03:26.680
how can you stand by
and do nothing, Duke Su?

03:26.760 --> 03:27.760
Brilliant.

03:27.840 --> 03:29.440
Is that a yes?

03:29.520 --> 03:30.800
State your request.

03:30.880 --> 03:33.600
Get me someone who's good
at vocal mimicry and ventriloquism.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.600
Is that it?

03:34.680 --> 03:35.520
Yes.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.240
- All right.
- Thank you.

03:39.280 --> 03:40.800
I won't disturb you any longer.

03:40.880 --> 03:41.760
I shall take my leave.

03:44.120 --> 03:44.960
Li.

03:48.120 --> 03:49.360
What did you say earlier?

03:50.120 --> 03:50.960
What?

03:51.520 --> 03:54.360
You said it'd be in my interest,

03:54.440 --> 03:56.000
so it's not overstepping.

03:56.080 --> 03:58.160
I know I owe you a lot.

03:58.640 --> 04:00.200
I panicked a little,

04:00.280 --> 04:02.200
so I tried to find an excuse.

04:02.760 --> 04:04.160
I used to think

04:04.240 --> 04:06.440
I could pay you back
everything I owed you.

04:06.520 --> 04:07.760
Now that I've done the math,

04:08.480 --> 04:09.800
I don't think I can pay you back.

04:09.880 --> 04:10.840
Don't pay me back then.

04:10.920 --> 04:12.120
You'll suffer losses.

04:12.200 --> 04:13.240
I can afford it.

04:17.600 --> 04:18.600
I'll get going then.

04:30.560 --> 04:32.440
So the people
at the Imperial Diviner Office…

04:32.520 --> 04:33.480
Withdraw them.

04:33.560 --> 04:34.520
Yes.

04:34.600 --> 04:36.440
But how can Ms. Jiang Li deal

04:36.520 --> 04:38.480
with the whole
Imperial Diviner Office on her own?

04:38.560 --> 04:39.440
It's all right.

04:40.920 --> 04:42.200
If I can afford to lose,

04:43.080 --> 04:44.240
she can too.

04:44.320 --> 04:46.160
Ms. Jiang Li
has someone to support her now.

04:46.240 --> 04:47.160
That's great.

04:49.640 --> 04:51.440
Today, you'll be spared from flogging

04:51.520 --> 04:52.600
as I'm in a good mood.

04:56.040 --> 04:58.760
Are we all set for tomorrow?

04:58.840 --> 04:59.760
Yes.

05:00.400 --> 05:02.240
The Imperial Diviner
will arrive at 11:45 a.m.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.680
When the time comes,

05:05.760 --> 05:08.080
just put this pill into Ruoyao's mouth.

05:09.240 --> 05:10.720
Keep a close eye on Concubine Hu.

05:10.800 --> 05:12.080
Don't let her sabotage my plan.

05:12.920 --> 05:13.880
Madam Ji,

05:13.960 --> 05:17.120
I feel like the Imperial Diviner
is up to no good.

05:17.680 --> 05:18.520
What should we do

05:18.600 --> 05:20.600
if something goes wrong again?

05:20.680 --> 05:21.960
What's there to worry about?

05:22.440 --> 05:24.520
You're risking your life.

05:25.760 --> 05:27.600
Do we have to go this far?

05:28.480 --> 05:29.720
Jin Dai,

05:30.440 --> 05:31.960
how many years have you been with me?

05:32.600 --> 05:34.360
Since you were born,

05:35.080 --> 05:36.680
it has been more than 30 years.

05:37.240 --> 05:39.080
I've changed a lot

05:39.160 --> 05:40.320
since then, haven't I?

05:43.400 --> 05:44.280
Speak your mind.

05:45.520 --> 05:46.400
Since you were a kid,

05:47.120 --> 05:49.320
you've been the most
opinionated one in the family.

05:49.400 --> 05:51.240
You also disobeyed your father the most.

05:51.960 --> 05:53.200
But now,

05:54.520 --> 05:56.360
you're becoming more and more like him.

06:00.440 --> 06:01.880
Even you think I've changed,

06:02.600 --> 06:03.480
don't you?

06:03.560 --> 06:06.600
Madam Ji, actually, whatever you become

06:07.160 --> 06:09.200
is the same to me.

06:10.240 --> 06:13.320
I'll protect you no matter what.

06:13.800 --> 06:16.400
But I don't want to see you unhappy.

06:17.160 --> 06:19.760
I really miss

06:20.240 --> 06:21.760
the eldest daughter of the Ji family,

06:22.920 --> 06:24.600
who was carefree

06:25.080 --> 06:27.280
and always had a smile on her face.

06:33.360 --> 06:35.000
Once Jiang Li is out of the picture,

06:35.640 --> 06:37.000
everything will be fine.

06:41.520 --> 06:43.160
You must take care of yourself.

06:47.120 --> 06:48.240
I shall take my leave.

06:49.560 --> 06:53.320
SIMPLE AND ELEGANT

07:08.960 --> 07:11.360
Miss, the person Duke Su got has arrived.

07:11.440 --> 07:13.240
I've helped her change
into a maid's clothes.

07:13.320 --> 07:14.600
She's with Bai Xue right now.

07:14.680 --> 07:16.080
Remember to tell her

07:16.160 --> 07:17.360
to stay close to me today.

07:19.240 --> 07:21.040
Not too close, but not too far.

07:21.120 --> 07:21.960
All right.

07:23.440 --> 07:25.560
I think there will be a ruckus today.

07:26.120 --> 07:27.520
I don't have time to watch over you.

07:28.000 --> 07:29.320
Find a safe place.

07:29.400 --> 07:30.560
Don't worry, miss.

07:30.640 --> 07:31.960
I'm agile.

07:32.040 --> 07:32.880
Come here.

07:36.320 --> 07:37.320
Once this is over,

07:38.240 --> 07:39.280
do you have any plans?

07:39.360 --> 07:41.760
Actually, I'm quite tacky.

07:41.840 --> 07:44.360
I just want to live
a life of comfort and luxury.

07:44.440 --> 07:46.760
I don't want to live
like the old days in Zhennv Hall

07:46.840 --> 07:49.720
when I didn't have enough
food to eat or clothes to keep warm.

07:58.840 --> 07:59.720
What is this?

08:00.280 --> 08:01.120
Open it and see.

08:05.520 --> 08:06.960
Once this is over,

08:07.040 --> 08:08.680
I'll be more than happy

08:10.120 --> 08:11.560
if you choose to stay with me.

08:12.280 --> 08:14.040
But now, you know how to read.

08:14.120 --> 08:16.080
If you want to explore the world someday,

08:16.880 --> 08:19.000
I have bought you a house in Luyang.

08:19.800 --> 08:22.360
You can try to make a living
by running a small business.

08:22.920 --> 08:25.160
If you want to marry someday,

08:25.680 --> 08:27.000
just find a good man.

08:27.600 --> 08:29.040
If you don't,

08:29.120 --> 08:32.440
you'll be able to live a life
of comfort and luxury as you wish.

08:32.520 --> 08:34.039
How could I deserve this?

08:34.880 --> 08:35.720
Tong'er,

08:35.799 --> 08:37.880
I've long thought of you
as my own younger sister.

08:38.960 --> 08:40.280
Don't ever say that again.

08:41.440 --> 08:42.559
Miss.

08:45.720 --> 08:52.720
JIANG RESIDENCE

09:12.760 --> 09:16.680
JIANG RESIDENCE

09:20.240 --> 09:21.360
Greetings, Chancellor Jiang.

09:24.480 --> 09:27.680
You're in charge of palace rituals.

09:28.320 --> 09:30.640
Thank you for coming all the way here

09:30.720 --> 09:32.040
for a trivial matter of my family.

09:32.120 --> 09:33.800
Chancellor Jiang, you flatter me.

09:33.880 --> 09:35.960
It all boils down to fate.

09:36.040 --> 09:37.120
I came to Jiang Residence

09:37.200 --> 09:38.680
to fulfill my destiny.

09:40.320 --> 09:42.160
- Please come in.
- Chancellor Jiang, after you.

09:56.760 --> 09:58.120
Is she Ms. Jiang Ruoyao?

09:59.240 --> 10:00.080
Yes.

10:23.520 --> 10:27.120
Evil spirits are born in the heart
and evil grudges take shape.

10:27.200 --> 10:30.280
No shadow in a thousand years,
no root in the ages.

10:30.880 --> 10:33.320
With summoning, you have nowhere to go.

10:33.400 --> 10:35.160
Show yourself, you evil spirit!

10:37.840 --> 10:38.760
Yao'er.

10:39.800 --> 10:40.640
Yao'er.

10:41.200 --> 10:42.040
Yao'er.

10:42.120 --> 10:43.640
Yao'er.

10:48.200 --> 10:49.560
Yao'er.

10:50.160 --> 10:51.240
Yao'er.

10:54.120 --> 10:54.960
Yao'er.

10:55.840 --> 10:56.760
Yao'er!

10:56.840 --> 10:57.760
Yao'er.

10:58.280 --> 10:59.720
- What's wrong with my daughter?
- Yao'er.

10:59.800 --> 11:02.160
Ms. Jiang Ruoyao is possessed
by an evil spirit.

11:02.240 --> 11:04.600
This evil spirit is so powerful

11:04.680 --> 11:06.320
that it has almost
sucked out her vital qi.

11:06.400 --> 11:08.320
If it can't be eliminated from the source,

11:08.920 --> 11:10.080
her life will be in danger.

11:10.920 --> 11:12.040
Imperial Diviner,

11:12.120 --> 11:13.840
where is the evil spirit now?

11:13.920 --> 11:15.280
Just now, I saw a dark haze

11:15.360 --> 11:18.120
hovering over your residence at the door.

11:18.720 --> 11:20.960
I'm afraid the evil spirit
is in the residence.

11:22.920 --> 11:25.760
Nothing strange has ever happened
in this residence.

11:25.840 --> 11:28.000
How can there be an evil spirit here
for no reason?

11:28.080 --> 11:31.120
Imperial Diviner, are you mistaken?

11:31.200 --> 11:32.760
Madam Ji, something big has happened.

11:33.640 --> 11:35.560
The ancestral shrine is on fire.

11:35.640 --> 11:37.400
Even the courtyard next door is on fire.

11:37.480 --> 11:39.400
We must get rid of the evil spirit
as soon as possible.

11:39.480 --> 11:41.160
If the evil spirit forms and invades,

11:41.240 --> 11:42.840
more disasters will happen

11:42.920 --> 11:44.040
to all of your family.

11:44.120 --> 11:44.960
In serious cases,

11:45.440 --> 11:46.400
you'll lose their lives.

11:46.960 --> 11:50.040
Yao'er. Nothing can happen to my Yao'er.

11:50.920 --> 11:51.760
Yao'er.

11:52.680 --> 11:53.520
Yao'er.

11:54.320 --> 11:55.360
Yao'er.

11:56.920 --> 11:57.880
Imperial Diviner,

11:58.760 --> 12:00.120
how do we exorcize the evil spirit?

12:00.760 --> 12:02.280
The evil spirit needs a host.

12:02.360 --> 12:05.640
Chancellor Jiang, please gather
everyone in the residence immediately.

12:06.280 --> 12:09.480
I need to perform a ritual
and ask the spirit

12:09.560 --> 12:10.920
to find the host.

13:39.480 --> 13:43.880
The righteousness of the way of heaven
lets everything go back to its origin.

13:43.960 --> 13:47.080
Water purifies,
spiritual talismans hold divine will.

13:48.680 --> 13:51.800
Subdue evil spirits
and reveal their true forms.

13:51.880 --> 13:54.800
All demons and monsters
could hide nowhere.

13:55.360 --> 13:56.840
Demons and monsters?

13:58.560 --> 13:59.880
It looks like a stunt to me.

14:01.920 --> 14:02.760
Be quiet.

14:02.840 --> 14:03.800
It's true.

14:04.360 --> 14:05.560
I think so too.

14:16.120 --> 14:18.840
It's said that the peach wood sword
can ward off evil spirits.

14:19.400 --> 14:22.040
If there's really an evil spirit
in our residence,

14:22.120 --> 14:24.080
it'll certainly be eliminated.

14:24.160 --> 14:26.880
A wandering spirit
left the grave without permission.

14:26.960 --> 14:29.200
A true shrine, a false disturbance.

14:29.280 --> 14:31.520
The gates of heaven and earth have opened.

14:32.000 --> 14:34.640
Lost soul, appear now!

14:44.800 --> 14:46.160
- My lady!
- Jiang Li!

14:48.720 --> 14:49.640
Imperial Diviner,

14:50.520 --> 14:51.560
what's the meaning of this?

14:51.640 --> 14:52.680
Chancellor Jiang,

14:52.760 --> 14:56.760
this lady in the residence
is the host of the evil spirit.

15:06.680 --> 15:09.600
This lady is possessed by an evil spirit.

15:09.680 --> 15:11.560
If we don't get rid of it in time,

15:11.640 --> 15:13.400
not only will it harm her,

15:13.480 --> 15:17.800
but the entire Jiang family
will also be in chaos from now on.

15:18.720 --> 15:19.760
Nonsense!

15:19.840 --> 15:21.960
How can there be
an evil spirit in Ms. Jiang Li?

15:22.040 --> 15:23.440
You're just slandering her.

15:23.520 --> 15:24.800
What nonsense are you spouting?

15:24.880 --> 15:26.520
How can Jiang Li be an evil spirit?

15:26.600 --> 15:29.000
Li'er is usually very gentle and quiet.

15:29.080 --> 15:31.720
She doesn't look like
an evil spirit's host.

15:31.800 --> 15:33.800
Is there a misunderstanding here?

15:33.880 --> 15:36.120
Imperial Diviner, you must be mistaken.

15:36.200 --> 15:38.480
There can't be an evil spirit in Jiang Li.

15:38.560 --> 15:39.760
Yes, Imperial Diviner.

15:40.320 --> 15:42.680
Li'er lived in Zhennv Hall
on Qingcheng Mountain

15:42.760 --> 15:43.600
for ten years.

15:44.120 --> 15:46.040
Zhennv Hall is a pure place.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.520
How can there be evil things?

15:47.600 --> 15:48.720
You're wrong.

15:49.800 --> 15:51.600
The tall trees
and thick grass in the mountains

15:51.680 --> 15:53.120
are the most humid,

15:53.880 --> 15:55.760
so they easily attracts evil spirits,

15:56.240 --> 15:58.000
leading to evil thoughts.

15:58.080 --> 15:59.760
Since this lady

15:59.840 --> 16:01.760
stayed in Zhennv Hall before,

16:01.840 --> 16:04.120
an evil spirit must have followed her.

16:04.200 --> 16:07.120
And since her return, her mind
has gotten increasingly disturbed.

16:07.840 --> 16:10.920
I'm afraid the reason lies

16:11.760 --> 16:14.600
in Qingcheng Mountain.

16:17.440 --> 16:19.800
You can say anything you want.

16:19.880 --> 16:21.280
Why should we believe you?

16:22.080 --> 16:23.640
Why should we just believe

16:23.720 --> 16:25.000
whatever you say?

16:27.040 --> 16:28.080
Mind your manners.

16:28.160 --> 16:29.320
I was just telling the truth.

16:29.960 --> 16:31.400
I'm sorry, Imperial Diviner.

16:31.480 --> 16:32.840
We just don't understand it.

16:32.920 --> 16:33.800
But Li'er

16:33.880 --> 16:36.600
is a sensible and well-mannered
young lady of the Jiang family.

16:36.680 --> 16:39.320
Please be more careful before judging her.

16:39.400 --> 16:41.360
The personality of people

16:41.440 --> 16:43.480
possessed by evil spirits
usually changes drastically.

16:44.680 --> 16:46.240
May I ask if this lady's personality

16:46.320 --> 16:49.600
has greatly changed

16:49.680 --> 16:51.760
since her return?

16:53.960 --> 16:54.920
Yes.

16:55.480 --> 16:58.600
Ms. Jiang Li's personality and temperament
are completely different

16:58.680 --> 17:00.600
after her return.

17:00.680 --> 17:03.000
It's as if she's a different person.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.839
- Yes.
- That's true.

17:06.560 --> 17:08.560
I just feel sorry for Ms. Jiang Li,

17:08.640 --> 17:10.480
who lived in Zhennv Hall for ten years.

17:11.440 --> 17:14.000
When she was about to return
to Jiang Residence,

17:14.560 --> 17:17.480
she was brutally murdered by someone.

17:18.040 --> 17:20.720
I'm afraid even Ms. Jiang Li's father,
the Chief Secretariat,

17:21.319 --> 17:23.760
is in the dark.

17:24.640 --> 17:26.000
The Imperial Diviner is right.

17:26.880 --> 17:28.040
A person's personality

17:28.119 --> 17:29.480
can't change drastically

17:29.560 --> 17:31.040
in a short period of time indeed.

17:31.120 --> 17:33.080
But I left home and lived in Zhennv Hall

17:33.600 --> 17:35.280
for not just a day or two,

17:35.360 --> 17:36.680
not a month or two,

17:37.560 --> 17:38.600
but ten years.

17:40.080 --> 17:43.200
Ten years is not
a short period of time, is it?

17:44.560 --> 17:46.280
If Mrs. Liu

17:46.360 --> 17:47.720
hadn't met me in Zhennv Hall,

17:48.280 --> 17:50.440
I'd still be kneeling there

17:50.520 --> 17:52.680
for one whole day
without drinking a drop of water.

17:53.240 --> 17:54.920
That was the norm in Zhennv Hall.

17:55.000 --> 17:56.320
Not having enough food to eat

17:56.960 --> 17:58.000
and clothes to keep warm,

17:58.560 --> 17:59.760
getting beaten at every turn,

17:59.840 --> 18:01.400
and not even allowed to beg for mercy.

18:02.160 --> 18:04.040
With such a cycle,

18:05.200 --> 18:07.480
even the most honorable and gentle woman

18:07.560 --> 18:09.200
or the most innocent and naive child

18:10.080 --> 18:13.040
won't have the same personality as before.

18:14.240 --> 18:16.080
As for the habits mentioned earlier…

18:16.640 --> 18:17.600
Father,

18:19.600 --> 18:21.720
I've always loved meat,

18:22.720 --> 18:24.280
soft quilts,

18:24.880 --> 18:26.160
and brightly colored materials

18:26.880 --> 18:28.120
for my clothes.

18:29.080 --> 18:31.000
But in all my years in Zhennv Hall,

18:32.560 --> 18:34.560
I've only had one quilt for my bed.

18:35.280 --> 18:36.560
After using it for a long time,

18:36.640 --> 18:37.960
all that's left are cotton scraps.

18:38.840 --> 18:40.240
Forget colorful clothes.

18:40.320 --> 18:42.080
Just being able to keep warm
is good enough.

18:42.640 --> 18:45.840
If I were still as arrogant as before

18:45.920 --> 18:47.760
and still insisted
on the same habits as before,

18:48.520 --> 18:49.640
I might be dead already.

18:50.360 --> 18:51.440
I changed

18:52.760 --> 18:54.240
just to survive.

18:55.880 --> 18:56.880
Did you hear that?

18:56.960 --> 18:58.680
Jiang Li was forced by circumstances.

18:58.760 --> 19:00.480
There's no such thing as an evil spirit.

19:13.240 --> 19:14.600
What do you know?

19:15.120 --> 19:16.760
Although evil spirits are bad,

19:17.240 --> 19:18.640
they're spirits after all.

19:18.720 --> 19:21.200
And if they're in a person's body
for a long time,

19:21.280 --> 19:22.920
they will cultivate with their hosts,

19:23.000 --> 19:26.080
capture their souls, master their skills,

19:26.160 --> 19:27.920
and take shape.

19:28.480 --> 19:30.920
They're not to be trifled with.

19:31.480 --> 19:33.040
And they'll keep looking for new hosts

19:33.120 --> 19:34.640
before they take shape.

19:35.280 --> 19:37.920
Then they can take
the previous host's cultivation

19:38.480 --> 19:39.760
with them.

19:40.360 --> 19:43.440
Ms. Jiang Li is skilled
at playing the guqin

19:43.520 --> 19:45.040
although she has never had a teacher.

19:45.120 --> 19:48.200
And she surprised everyone
with her skill at the Annual Exam.

19:48.280 --> 19:53.160
Perhaps this is the cultivation
brought by the evil spirit.

19:53.240 --> 19:54.080
Besides,

19:54.160 --> 19:57.320
Ms. Jiang Li risked her life
to overturn Magistrate Xue's conviction

19:57.400 --> 20:00.000
and she looks very similar
to Magistrate Xue's daughter,

20:00.080 --> 20:01.720
Xue Fangfei.

20:02.200 --> 20:04.520
The last host of this evil spirit

20:05.040 --> 20:08.520
was probably the late Xue Fangfei.

20:13.720 --> 20:14.800
That's why I said

20:15.280 --> 20:20.080
the reason for this
might lie in Qingcheng Mountain.

20:20.640 --> 20:23.800
Everyone, think about it yourselves.

20:26.200 --> 20:28.720
- Xue Fangfei? On Qingcheng Mountain?
- After Li'er

20:28.800 --> 20:31.520
overturned Magistrate Xue's case,

20:31.600 --> 20:33.320
she did not send him back to Huaixiang.

20:34.080 --> 20:35.960
She even got him a physician
and some medicines.

20:36.040 --> 20:37.320
She cares for him so much.

20:37.880 --> 20:40.000
But before that, Li'er had no connection

20:40.080 --> 20:41.360
with Xue Huaiyuan.

20:41.440 --> 20:43.560
Why would she be
so concerned about an outsider?

20:44.840 --> 20:45.960
Could it be true that…

20:47.320 --> 20:48.360
Ms. Jiang Li,

20:49.320 --> 20:51.440
have you ever encountered Xue Fangfei

20:51.520 --> 20:52.640
and met her in person?

20:52.720 --> 20:54.080
Of course I did.

20:54.640 --> 20:57.280
I survived thanks to Xue Fangfei's help.

20:58.200 --> 21:00.040
I'm grateful to her for saving my life.

21:00.120 --> 21:01.040
It makes sense then!

21:01.120 --> 21:02.000
That evil spirit

21:02.080 --> 21:04.560
originally possessed Xue Fangfei
and did evil things.

21:04.640 --> 21:05.800
After Xue Fangfei died,

21:05.880 --> 21:07.760
it possessed Ms. Jiang Li.

21:07.840 --> 21:10.480
This evil spirit is vicious and cunning.

21:10.560 --> 21:12.000
If we don't get rid of it in time,

21:12.080 --> 21:13.920
the entire Jiang family
might be in danger.

21:16.560 --> 21:19.480
Father! Mother!

21:19.560 --> 21:20.560
Ms. Ruoyao.

21:21.840 --> 21:22.760
Yao'er.

21:22.840 --> 21:23.800
Ruoyao.

21:24.960 --> 21:26.720
- Mother!
- My daughter.

21:26.800 --> 21:28.200
My Yao'er.

21:29.280 --> 21:30.320
- Imperial Diviner.
- Mother!

21:30.400 --> 21:33.640
What are you going to do
about the evil spirit in my daughter?

21:33.720 --> 21:35.440
Your residence is not a pure place,

21:35.520 --> 21:37.200
so I can't easily
suppress the evil spirit.

21:37.280 --> 21:40.400
I need to take Ms. Jiang Li to the temple

21:40.960 --> 21:43.720
to perform rituals for a few months

21:43.800 --> 21:45.120
to get rid of the evil spirit.

21:46.880 --> 21:48.280
Father!

21:49.040 --> 21:50.680
Mother!

21:58.000 --> 22:01.240
Chancellor Jiang,
you have to make up your mind soon.

22:01.320 --> 22:03.920
If we wait until the evil spirit
completely takes over the body,

22:04.000 --> 22:05.280
it'll be too late.

22:06.840 --> 22:08.920
Yuanbai, you don't really believe
that an evil spirit

22:09.000 --> 22:10.480
possessed Jiang Li, do you?

22:10.560 --> 22:11.720
Uncle Yuanbai,

22:11.800 --> 22:13.560
please don't believe in people's slander.

22:14.120 --> 22:16.560
Jiang Li already suffered once
in Zhennv Hall.

22:17.120 --> 22:18.840
If she suffers a second time,

22:18.920 --> 22:21.080
- it will kill her.
- Yes.

22:21.160 --> 22:22.960
My lord, Ms. Jiang Li is innocent.

22:23.040 --> 22:25.960
There can't be any evil spirits
in our residence.

22:26.040 --> 22:28.600
- Yuanbai, make a decision quickly.
- Yes, Yuanbai. Make a decision now.

22:28.680 --> 22:30.560
You can't let our family
be destroyed like this.

22:30.640 --> 22:32.680
- Or we can't live in peace, Yuanbai.
- Yes, Yuanbai.

22:32.760 --> 22:34.120
Aunt Yang, what are you saying?

22:34.200 --> 22:35.480
How could you say such nonsense?

22:35.560 --> 22:37.120
- How is it nonsense?
- Enough!

22:37.200 --> 22:38.160
Quiet!

22:48.080 --> 22:50.720
Dear, what do you think?

22:50.800 --> 22:53.480
Since the exorcism is harmless,

22:54.120 --> 22:56.680
why don't we let the Imperial Diviner
take her back to check?

22:56.760 --> 22:58.920
It's not like she won't be brought back.

22:59.000 --> 23:01.080
Ruoyao is already in this state.

23:01.640 --> 23:04.640
If anything happens to Jiang Li,
I won't be able to live on either.

23:04.720 --> 23:05.760
Uncle Yuanbai!

23:09.320 --> 23:10.720
Father!

23:10.800 --> 23:11.760
Ms. Ruoyao.

23:13.520 --> 23:15.520
I'm in so much pain!

23:16.080 --> 23:18.640
Yao'er. My Yao'er.

23:18.720 --> 23:19.840
I'm in so much pain!

23:19.920 --> 23:21.280
Yao'er.

23:25.240 --> 23:26.320
Yao'er.

23:27.480 --> 23:28.480
Yao'er.

23:35.480 --> 23:36.520
Yao'er.

23:39.120 --> 23:40.480
Yao'er.

23:44.720 --> 23:46.400
What should we do?

23:48.160 --> 23:49.000
All right.

23:59.200 --> 24:00.240
Jiang Li.

24:03.080 --> 24:04.160
- Li'er.
- Jiang Li.

24:05.240 --> 24:06.160
Li'er.

24:09.560 --> 24:10.680
What's going on?

24:10.760 --> 24:11.760
Ms. Jiang Li.

24:21.920 --> 24:22.760
- Li'er.
- Jiang Li.

24:22.840 --> 24:24.720
- Li'er, are you all right?
- Jiang Li, don't scare me.

24:25.280 --> 24:26.120
Are you all right?

24:31.200 --> 24:32.040
Jiang Li.

24:35.560 --> 24:36.480
Li'er.

24:51.240 --> 24:52.320
Father.

24:53.440 --> 24:54.920
- Ms. Jiang Li.
- Father.

24:56.800 --> 24:58.640
- Why's she like a different person?
- What's going on?

24:58.720 --> 24:59.840
Father.

24:59.920 --> 25:01.360
I feel so much pain.

25:01.440 --> 25:03.000
- It hurts so much.
- Yue'er?

25:06.080 --> 25:07.040
Yue'er.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.400
- Imperial Diviner.
- Yue'er.

25:12.480 --> 25:14.280
Jiang Li has been possessed
by an evil spirit.

25:14.360 --> 25:15.200
Take her away!

25:15.280 --> 25:16.680
Take her away!

25:17.800 --> 25:19.040
Father.

25:19.120 --> 25:20.120
Father, help me.

25:20.200 --> 25:21.520
Father, help me.

25:22.040 --> 25:24.120
Let go of my Yue'er!

25:24.200 --> 25:25.120
Let go of my daughter!

25:25.200 --> 25:26.400
- Father.
- My Yue'er.

25:26.480 --> 25:27.440
- Concubine Hu?
- Yue'er.

25:27.520 --> 25:28.840
- Why is she here?
- Yue'er.

25:29.520 --> 25:31.040
- I have no idea.
- My Yue'er.

25:31.760 --> 25:32.720
My lord.

25:32.800 --> 25:33.720
My lord.

25:33.800 --> 25:34.720
Don't you remember?

25:34.800 --> 25:36.240
It's Yue'er's voice.

25:36.320 --> 25:38.840
- It's Yue'er's voice.
- Yue'er.

25:38.920 --> 25:41.240
Get someone to take her away. Quick.

25:41.320 --> 25:42.520
- Yes. Guards.
- It's Yue'er.

25:42.600 --> 25:43.800
Concubine Hu, come with me.

25:43.880 --> 25:45.360
- No.
- Don't spout nonsense.

25:45.440 --> 25:47.320
- Take her away. Don't spout nonsense.
- My lord.

25:47.400 --> 25:48.320
Let go of me!

25:48.400 --> 25:49.400
Father!

25:49.480 --> 25:50.440
Yue'er.

25:51.000 --> 25:52.280
That's our Yue'er.

25:52.840 --> 25:53.680
- Father.
- Dear.

25:53.760 --> 25:55.360
Father, help me.

25:55.440 --> 25:56.800
Stop!

25:57.800 --> 25:59.000
Stop, all of you.

26:00.760 --> 26:01.920
Let go of her.

26:03.520 --> 26:05.720
This concerns
my eldest granddaughter, Jiang Yue.

26:05.800 --> 26:08.000
No one can leave
until we get to the bottom of this.

26:08.080 --> 26:10.600
Old Madam, it's this crazy woman's doing.

26:10.680 --> 26:12.560
- Ms. Sun, take her away.
- Yes.

26:12.640 --> 26:13.520
Old Madam,

26:14.040 --> 26:14.960
I'm really not crazy.

26:15.720 --> 26:18.440
How could I not recognize
my own daughter's voice?

26:18.520 --> 26:19.560
- Father.
- Old Madam.

26:20.120 --> 26:21.520
- Father.
- She's really Yue'er.

26:21.600 --> 26:23.840
- Father, help me!
- My lord, listen.

26:23.920 --> 26:25.320
Yue'er is calling you.

26:25.400 --> 26:27.640
- Father. Father, help me!
- She's calling you.

26:27.720 --> 26:28.600
Father!

26:28.680 --> 26:30.080
- Yue'er.
- Dear.

26:30.160 --> 26:32.080
Concubine Hu is really sick this time.

26:32.160 --> 26:33.280
She's not sick.

26:34.240 --> 26:36.400
This is Yue'er's voice.

26:36.480 --> 26:37.560
It's our Yue'er.

26:40.320 --> 26:41.160
Yue'er.

26:42.000 --> 26:42.840
Yue'er.

26:45.320 --> 26:46.680
Yue'er.

26:46.760 --> 26:48.200
My Yue'er,

26:48.280 --> 26:49.360
I'm sorry.

26:49.440 --> 26:51.240
I feel so much pain.

26:51.320 --> 26:52.960
Where does it hurt? Tell me.

26:56.040 --> 26:57.240
My head hurts.

26:57.320 --> 26:58.800
There's blood all over my head.

26:58.880 --> 27:00.800
- My head hurts so much!
- Dear.

27:00.880 --> 27:02.120
- Don't be afraid.
- All right.

27:02.200 --> 27:03.280
Yue'er.

27:04.640 --> 27:06.520
I won't dare to bully Ruoyao anymore.

27:06.600 --> 27:07.760
Mother, don't push me.

27:07.840 --> 27:08.920
My head hurts so much.

27:09.480 --> 27:10.680
There's blood all over my head.

27:10.760 --> 27:12.920
- Don't kill me!
- Don't be afraid.

27:13.000 --> 27:14.400
Don't kill me!

27:14.480 --> 27:15.720
- Nonsense!
- Don't kill me!

27:15.800 --> 27:16.960
Jiang Li,

27:17.040 --> 27:19.280
this is a trick of the evil spirit
to mesmerize people.

27:19.360 --> 27:21.680
- You're the one who killed Yue'er.
- No!

27:21.760 --> 27:23.680
- Don't be afraid, Yue'er.
- You killed my Yue'er!

27:23.760 --> 27:24.680
Don't kill me.

27:24.760 --> 27:27.040
My daughter was only eight years old.
Why did you kill her?

27:27.120 --> 27:28.800
- Don't touch Madam Ji.
- Why?

27:30.160 --> 27:32.760
- Why?
- Don't be afraid.

27:38.320 --> 27:39.240
Let go of me.

27:39.720 --> 27:40.600
Let go!

27:43.360 --> 27:44.680
Why?

27:46.480 --> 27:47.400
- My lady.
- Jiang Li.

27:58.280 --> 27:59.360
Father.

28:00.280 --> 28:01.120
Grandmother.

28:17.640 --> 28:19.240
The Imperial Diviner is really something.

28:20.480 --> 28:21.480
I could really sense

28:22.280 --> 28:23.800
something unseen.

28:29.760 --> 28:30.600
Father,

28:32.280 --> 28:33.880
I saw a little girl.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.560
She said her name was Jiang Yue.

28:39.200 --> 28:41.120
She begged me to apologize to her mother.

28:44.280 --> 28:45.840
What exactly did you see?

28:47.720 --> 28:48.960
I saw

28:49.560 --> 28:50.880
Jiang Yue playing with Ruoyao.

28:51.480 --> 28:53.000
Just because Ruoyao was crying,

28:53.080 --> 28:55.120
Mother took it out on Jiang Yue

28:56.840 --> 28:58.600
and pushed her.

29:00.240 --> 29:01.440
Poor Jiang Yue died

29:02.040 --> 29:03.760
after hitting her head on the rockery,

29:04.960 --> 29:06.160
but someone made it look like

29:06.240 --> 29:08.200
she accidentally fell and drowned.

29:18.800 --> 29:22.760
Ji Shuran, you're so cruel!

29:24.480 --> 29:26.080
My poor Yue'er

29:26.800 --> 29:29.040
died at your hands.

29:31.000 --> 29:33.520
My Yue'er!

29:34.760 --> 29:37.040
My Yue'er.

29:38.440 --> 29:39.480
Nonsense!

29:40.120 --> 29:41.680
Jiang Li is possessed by an evil spirit.

29:41.760 --> 29:42.640
Imperial Diviner!

29:42.720 --> 29:44.360
Is this all you've got?

29:44.440 --> 29:45.960
Take down the evil spirit!

29:46.800 --> 29:49.480
They said Jiang Li
committed matricide and fratricide.

29:49.560 --> 29:50.760
The mother was me

29:51.880 --> 29:53.080
and the child she killed

29:53.960 --> 29:54.800
was yours.

29:58.760 --> 30:00.120
I was pregnant back then,

30:00.640 --> 30:03.040
but she insisted
on taking me to the attic to play,

30:04.040 --> 30:05.600
making me fall and lose the baby.

30:06.320 --> 30:07.280
If it wasn't for her,

30:07.880 --> 30:09.080
you and I

30:09.560 --> 30:11.200
would still have a son.

30:11.760 --> 30:12.640
And you

30:12.720 --> 30:14.800
wouldn't have to live
in such loneliness and despair.

30:15.400 --> 30:17.720
I've always wanted to avenge my child.

30:18.280 --> 30:19.880
Don't you want to?

30:21.120 --> 30:22.200
So will you

30:22.760 --> 30:25.040
help me get rid of Jiang Li now?

30:25.120 --> 30:27.240
Ms. Jiang Li's soul
has been seized by Xue Fangfei.

30:27.320 --> 30:28.600
It must be exorcized immediately!

30:32.800 --> 30:34.240
Miss, be careful!

30:38.800 --> 30:40.520
The Imperial Diviner killed someone!

30:40.600 --> 30:41.560
Let's go.

30:41.640 --> 30:44.840
- Murder!
- Tong'er!

30:45.400 --> 30:46.960
- He killed someone!
- No!

30:49.240 --> 30:51.120
- Take him away!
- Old Madam.

30:52.320 --> 30:53.560
Take Old Madam back to her room!

30:57.960 --> 30:58.800
I…

31:01.280 --> 31:03.240
- Jiang Li, run!
- Rui'er, do you want to die!

31:03.880 --> 31:05.360
- Rui'er!
- Jiang Li, run! I'll fight you.

31:05.440 --> 31:07.040
Li'er, run!

31:07.120 --> 31:08.600
- Bai Xue, get a physician!
- Run!

31:08.680 --> 31:09.640
All right.

31:12.560 --> 31:13.440
Run, Jiang Li!

31:13.520 --> 31:14.800
Jiang Li!

31:25.200 --> 31:26.040
What…

32:14.280 --> 32:15.760
- What do you want?
- Don't come near me!

32:16.360 --> 32:17.240
Stay back!

32:17.960 --> 32:20.160
If any of you come any closer,
I'll kill her!

32:23.480 --> 32:24.320
Let's go.

32:29.640 --> 32:30.680
Imperial Diviner.

32:33.120 --> 32:34.280
Don't hurt Madam Ji.

32:34.960 --> 32:36.960
Don't hurt Madam Ji!

33:43.120 --> 33:43.960
Liu Wencai.

33:55.680 --> 33:56.760
I'm so lucky.

33:59.520 --> 34:00.600
Before I die,

34:02.520 --> 34:06.240
you're the last person I see.

34:08.560 --> 34:09.719
This is so nice.

34:12.600 --> 34:14.080
You still owe me…

34:15.000 --> 34:16.480
You owe me your life.

34:18.239 --> 34:19.280
I'll find you

34:19.960 --> 34:21.960
in my next life.

35:20.360 --> 35:21.400
Wencai.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.680
There are a lot of them.

36:18.160 --> 36:19.880
- It's very inauspicious. It's so scary.
- Yes.

36:23.440 --> 36:26.320
- It's so serious.
- How did something so bad happen? Look.

36:34.720 --> 36:39.920
I haven't put away Shuran's stuff yet.

36:40.000 --> 36:42.760
Let go of me!

37:21.360 --> 37:22.280
Miss,

37:23.880 --> 37:24.800
I'm sorry.

37:26.440 --> 37:29.000
I can't be with you until the end.

37:33.080 --> 37:35.440
The time I spent with you

37:36.640 --> 37:40.800
was the happiest time of my life.

37:42.840 --> 37:46.880
I want to meet you again
as your sister in the next life.

37:48.480 --> 37:49.480
No.

37:49.560 --> 37:50.440
Miss,

37:50.520 --> 37:51.840
I'm glad

37:54.560 --> 37:57.680
I'm finally going to her ladyship.

37:58.320 --> 37:59.280
Tong'er.

37:59.920 --> 38:01.240
Please

38:03.240 --> 38:06.920
bury me next to her ladyship.

40:13.200 --> 40:15.360
You're so beautiful.

40:17.760 --> 40:21.960
You look the most beautiful
when you smile.

40:25.080 --> 40:26.080
Don't cry.

40:26.920 --> 40:30.400
I like to see your smile.

40:32.280 --> 40:33.120
I won't cry.

41:08.120 --> 41:09.000
Tong'er!

41:11.240 --> 41:12.080
Tong'er!

41:12.960 --> 41:13.800
Tong'er!

41:15.480 --> 41:16.320
Tong'er!

41:20.280 --> 41:21.360
Don't take her away.

41:21.880 --> 41:22.720
Tong'er.

41:23.480 --> 41:24.600
Tong'er.

41:26.200 --> 41:28.320
You can't take her away.

41:31.000 --> 41:33.400
You can't take her away!

41:34.160 --> 41:35.120
Come back!

41:36.320 --> 41:37.160
Come back!

41:39.120 --> 41:40.120
- Jiang Li.
- Jiang Li.

41:41.240 --> 41:42.080
- Jiang Li.
- Tong'er.

41:43.600 --> 41:44.600
Jiang Li.

41:44.680 --> 41:46.200
- Tong'er.
- Jiang Li.

41:46.280 --> 41:47.800
Don't go.

41:48.760 --> 41:50.600
You can't take her away!

41:50.680 --> 41:51.880
Tong'er!

41:51.960 --> 41:52.800
Jiang Li.

42:02.440 --> 42:03.440
Li'er!

42:04.680 --> 42:06.480
Let her go!

42:07.160 --> 42:09.600
The sooner she leaves,
the sooner she'll be reincarnated!

42:09.680 --> 42:11.280
Tong'er!

42:12.760 --> 42:13.880
No!

42:14.680 --> 42:15.800
Jiang Li.

42:16.680 --> 42:17.720
- Jiang Li.
- Tong'er!

42:23.400 --> 42:24.680
Tong'er.

42:29.960 --> 42:31.880
Tong'er, don't go.

42:54.080 --> 42:55.320
I'm sorry.

43:00.000 --> 43:01.360
I'm sorry.

43:22.200 --> 43:24.200
Let's go with Madam Hu
to check out new fabrics today

43:24.680 --> 43:26.080
and dress her up.

43:32.360 --> 43:34.840
JI SHURAN ALSO KILLED YE ZHENZHEN

43:34.920 --> 43:37.600
BECAUSE SHE WANTED TO MARRY
INTO THE JIANG FAMILY

43:37.680 --> 43:39.560
Yue'er has finally redressed her justice.

43:41.360 --> 43:43.360
I can feel at ease in meeting her now.

43:45.560 --> 43:47.600
There's something
I've kept to myself for years.

43:49.320 --> 43:51.840
Ji Shuran also killed
Ye Zhenzhen back then

43:53.760 --> 43:55.800
because she wanted
to marry into the Jiang family.

44:03.640 --> 44:06.120
The Imperial Diviner Office
knows the method of divination

44:06.200 --> 44:08.040
and has a deep connection
with the inner court,

44:08.800 --> 44:11.440
but it fell into the hands
of such a treacherous and evil person.

44:12.040 --> 44:14.240
I've been unhappy
with the office for a long time.

44:14.320 --> 44:15.640
Now that this has happened,

44:15.720 --> 44:17.360
we can clean up and reorganize it.

44:19.760 --> 44:22.160
Wanning would never have expected

44:22.760 --> 44:24.800
that once Ms. Jiang Li joined the game,

44:24.880 --> 44:26.760
all her chess pieces would be eliminated.

44:27.240 --> 44:29.680
I guess we've made
the right bet this time.

44:56.960 --> 44:58.240
Xue Fangfei,

44:58.840 --> 45:00.200
just wait.

45:01.160 --> 45:03.080
The best part is yet to come.
